	(text "GP2..13: direct 3.3V through 33R. GP14 unused; GP23 senses panel power.\nRS485: GP0 TX, GP1 RX, GP15 direction. Panel 5V required also for USB programming.\nJ1 pin 1 = (13.202,15.600) mm from top-left, TOP VIEW. Verify mating height before fabrication."
